WEBVTT

00:41:58.402 --> 00:42:02.117
and they better damn
work well together, so yeah.

00:42:02.141 --> 00:42:04.991
And then, they have to have usefulness.

00:42:05.315 --> 00:42:06.910
And we've got to appreciate them.

00:42:06.934 --> 00:42:11.188
We have to establish --
just the reality, I think --

00:42:11.212 --> 00:42:15.347
that there is a level of basics.

00:42:15.371 --> 00:42:18.308
Basic education,

00:42:18.332 --> 00:42:22.148
basic health care --

00:42:22.172 --> 00:42:25.450
Basics that you cannot fall below.

00:42:26.469 --> 00:42:27.620
OK?

00:42:27.644 --> 00:42:30.945
Otherwise, when you go below that level,